{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.445, "data": {"request_id": "4ba9bdfe6268", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:05:30.310Z", "t_ms": 7390, "delta": " refinement, self-verification, and vector-based storage:\n\n* **Task-Driven Code Synthesis:** An automatic curriculum proposes increasingly complex tasks"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.989, "data": {"request_id": "4ba9bdfe6268", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:05:30.852Z", "t_ms": 7932, "delta": " [C1, C2]. To solve a task, GPT-4 generates executable programs representing temporally extended, reusable skills ["}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.022, "data": {"request_id": "4ba9bdfe6268", "seq": 31, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:05:30.886Z", "t_ms": 7965, "delta": "C1, C2]. The prompt provided to GPT-4 includes code guidelines, primitive control APIs, the agent's current state, chain"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.156, "data": {"request_id": "4ba9bdfe6268", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:05:31.023Z", "t_ms": 8102, "delta": "-of-thought reasoning steps, and relevant skills already retrieved from the library [C2, C5, C7].\n*"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.424, "data": {"request_id": "4ba9bdfe6268", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:05:31.279Z", "t_ms": 8358, "delta": " **Iterative Refinement:** Programs undergo an iterative prompting mechanism that refines code using three types of feedback: environment feedback"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.724, "data": {"request_id": "4ba9bdfe6268", "seq": 34, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:05:31.591Z", "t_ms": 8670, "delta": " (such as chat logs showing missing materials or intermediate progress), code interpreter execution errors, and critiques from a separate GPT-4 self-verification agent"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.039, "data": {"request_id": "4ba9bdfe6268", "seq": 35, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:05:31.824Z", "t_ms": 8903, "delta": " [C2, C3, C6].\n* **Self-Verification and Addition:** The GPT-4 critic assesses"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.15, "data": {"request_id": "4ba9bdfe6268", "seq": 36, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:05:32.009Z", "t_ms": 9088, "delta": " Voyager\u2019s state against the task requirements to confirm success [C3]. Once self-verification validates completion, the program"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.329, "data": {"request_id": "4ba9bdfe6268", "seq": 37, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:05:32.189Z", "t_ms": 9268, "delta": " is added to the skill library [C2, C3]. (If an agent remains stuck after 4 attempts,"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.508, "data": {"request_id": "4ba9bdfe6268", "seq": 38, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:05:32.375Z", "t_ms": 9454, "delta": " the curriculum moves on to another task) [C3].\n* **Indexing in a Vector Database:** Each newly acquired"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.62, "data": {"request_id": "4ba9bdfe6268", "seq": 39, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:05:32.485Z", "t_ms": 9564, "delta": " skill is stored in a vector database [C2]. GPT-3.5 generates a text description of the program;"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.778, "data": {"request_id": "4ba9bdfe6268", "seq": 40, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:05:32.645Z", "t_ms": 9724, "delta": " the embedding vector of this description serves as the key, and the executable program itself serves as the value [C2]."}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.98, "data": {"request_id": "4ba9bdfe6268", "seq": 41, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:05:32.842Z", "t_ms": 9921, "delta": "\n* **Compositional Growth:** When facing novel tasks, Voyager uses GPT-3.5 suggestions and environment context to retrieve"}}
